        "id": 1950816
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-31T02:00:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There\u0027s no usage of the return value, PLMK if you have an idea.\n\n- There\u0027s no definite order between `onWindowFocusChanged(false)` and `onStop()`. So it needs a mechanism for ensuring reading clipboard before VM suspend if possible. Noting that VM could be suspended before clipboard feature works properly, especially during setup wizard screen. OTOH, we cannot block VM suspend forever due to reading clipboard.\n- Sufficient log would be captured inside `readClipboardFromVm`.",
      "parentUuid": "9fc3b954_6aaae6a8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 762,
        "startChar": 12,
        "endLine": 762,
        "endChar": 54
      },
      "revId": "a9d7283ffd7a1a8335abfafab85a5814bcf99806",
